; 0xF47800-0xF4EFFF -- EIGHT MODULES AT THE HEAD OF THE 0x047800 `.incbin` SPAN
;   92 thunk slots, including six of prom_b's ten most-referenced unconverted
;   targets, converted as one contiguous block
